             "Example 1: Make a poster to describe your solid shape. Use words, numbers, and drawings to help other groups name your shape.\nApproach: “What is the same and what is different about the ways groups described your solid shape?” (Many groups gave details about the faces of the shapes, and some groups described objects that look like your shape.)",
